  "ruleText": "Plc 1907.02 Reinstatement of Certification After Expiration, Suspension, or Revocation. The procedures in Plc 312 shall govern the reobtaining of a certification after expiration, suspension, or revocation.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36\n\nAppendix A: State Statutes Implemented",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1900.html"
